Captured failure excerpt from npm run test:smoke after strengthening the native Save new workflow:
AssertionError [ERR_ASSERTION]: Expected values to be strictly equal:
40 !== 64
At the persisted preset assertion.
The smoke had polled main-process state before the renderer finished its save response. The controls now disable editing during pending saves and the smoke waits for visible save/update completion before continuing, then asserts persisted bytes immediately after update. Full instrumented successful diagnostic run is in smoke-debug.log.
